.TH AMERIKA-SHELL 1 "2026-10-21" "Amerika OS" "Amerika OS Manual"
.SH NAME
amerika\-shell \- the Amerika OS desktop shell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amerika\-shell
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B amerika\-shell
is Amerika OS's own desktop shell: the top bar with system tray, the dock, the launcher, the notification daemon, the desktop
wallpaper and the AI broker with its approval prompts. It is a GTK 4 program using gtk4\-layer\-shell and runs on the KWin
compositor. It is started and supervised by
.IR /usr/libexec/amerika/session\-start ;
a crash restarts it up to five times, and a clean exit ends the session (log out).
.PP
Start it by choosing
.B Amerika OS
on the login screen. Running it by hand inside another session is not supported.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B AMERIKA_SESSION
Set to 1 by
.BR amerika\-session .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/amerika/control.sock
Control socket (mode 0600) used by
.BR amerika\-mcp .
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/amerika\-os/ai\-audit.log
Audit log of AI tool calls.
.SH KEYS
Super opens the launcher; Ctrl+Alt+Esc pauses or resumes all AI actions. See the Amerika OS README for the full list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR amerika\-settings (1),
.BR amerika\-first\-run (1),
.BR amerika\-flavour (7)
